isaav ighe aŋgali, na aŋgal toman tapirimim, leso luutu tiina!","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Yam gabua tau aleep matamim yaryaare na, asov apait Yoova!","poem":1},{"text":"Aleluia, tapait Yoova!","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/tuc_tua/PSA/150.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/tuc_tua/JON/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/tuc_tua/PSA/149.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}